{
  "id": "dialogue.mamimi.yukata",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "まだ知らない one side",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mamimi.yukata",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mamimi.yukata",
    "idolId": "mamimi",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "ふふー。不过まみみ是坏孩子嘛──",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "就是这个！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "夏季偶像特集。之前有邀约，我一直在犹豫。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "看到你做这件衣服的样子，我想通了。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……说实话，一开始我觉得夏天和摩美々不太搭。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "明明夏天我也是我啊。真是失礼的制作人呢ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是、是啊，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "ふふー。你明白了就好ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──哦，好像要开拍了。加油。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "好ー。我会适可而止地试试ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……辛苦了，制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……怎么了？笑得那么得意ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "才、才没有笑！大概…………",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……摩美々身上，还有很多我不知道的地方啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……怎么突然这么说ー？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "只是觉得，刚才那场拍得很好。把摩美々新的一面拉出来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……制作人真是一如既往地夸张呢ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "嘛，我也不讨厌这种事……说不定还挺开心的。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。你开心就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那差不多，换衣服回去吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "是呢ー……",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "？怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……难得来一趟，回去之前去看看摊子吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "等、等一下，你穿那样去？",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "是啊。有什么问题吗ー？",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "也太显眼了……要是被粉丝围住怎么办。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "ふふー。那么担心的话，制作人也一起来怎么样？"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（今天要和她谈夏季特集的案子……）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……好，完成了ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？摩美々，你在做什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "这个啊ー，之前在事务所里找到的浴衣。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "想改成我喜欢的样子，应该会很可爱，就动手了ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "说不定哪天能用上呢ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "制作人？怎么了ー？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……啊，该不会是，随便动事务所里的东西，生气了？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
